    "title": "Terre Haute firefighters respond to fire at 7th and Park - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dana Winklepleck ,\n1 hours ago\nTERRE HAUTE, Ind. (WTWO/WAWV) - Terre Haute firefighters responded to a fire at a home located at South 7th and Park Streets shortly after 8 p.m. Wednesday night.\nAccording to the fire department, the home did not have any utilities hooked up to it.\nNo one was hurt. The cause of the fire is under investigation.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed.\nFor the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to MyWabashValley.com.",
